之和（十进制定点，不舍入中间值）</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="48.0" top="1344.0" width="1104.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="20" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">2. 折扣在税前从货品小计扣除 → 税前货品额 = 货品小计 − 折扣</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="48.0" top="1374.0" width="1104.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="20" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">3. 税额 = 税前货品额 × 6%，四舍五入至分（ROUND_HALF_UP）</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="48.0" top="1404.0" width="1104.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="20" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#334155" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">4. 最终应付 = 税前货品额 + 税额 + 运费；运费不计税</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="48.0" top="1508.0" width="1104.0" height="1.0"><Container color="#E2E8F0"/></Positioned><Positioned left="48.0" top="1522.0" width="700.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="20" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#64748B" textAlign="LEFT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">SN-2026-1107-008 · 第 1 页 / 共 2 页 · 币种 CNY</Text></Container></Positioned><Positioned left="652.0" top="1522.0" width="500.0"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="20" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" color="#64748B" textAlign="RIGHT" softWrap="true" maxLines="1">本单为虚构排版测试，不是实际发票。</Text></Container></Positioned></Stack></Container></Snapshot>